--- !u!114 &114816099306990993
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1127954485089557}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 302
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 刚离开客栈，你便隐约察觉一道微弱的神识扫过。这道神识并没有什么攻击性，但显然，是有什么人盯上了你。
  description:
